  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"248\" id=\"isPasted\">&nbsp;About our brand and products</h3><p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"579\">Limani London creates <strong data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"307\">luxurious yet personal jewellery</strong>—hand-finished in <strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"348\">925 Sterling Silver</strong> and&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"375\">solid 14k/18k Gold</strong> with ethically sourced stones.<br data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"409\">Every piece is designed for <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"458\">timeless elegance</strong> and <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"480\">everyday wear</strong>, from modern bridal sets to minimalist staples, and ships <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"552\">worldwide</strong> in premium gift packaging.</p><hr data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"584\"><h3 data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"615\">• What makes us different</h3><ul data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"934\"><li data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"724\"><p data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"659\">Heirloom quality at attainable prices</strong> – fine-jewellery craftsmanship without the traditional markup.</p></li><li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"819\"><p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"819\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"752\">Ethical &amp; sustainable</strong> – responsibly sourced metals and stones, small-batch production.</p></li><li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"934\"><p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"934\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"850\">Custom &amp; limited designs</strong> – frequent capsule drops and bespoke engraving options that keep audiences excited.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"939\"><h3 data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"970\">• How affiliates can earn</h3><ul data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1237\"><li data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1073\"><p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1073\"><strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"988\">Commission:</strong> Earn <strong>15</strong><strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1005\">&nbsp;%</strong> on every order tracked through your unique link or discount code.</p></li><li data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1147\"><p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1147\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1094\">Cookie window:</strong> 30 days—get credit even if customers return later.</p></li><li data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1237\"><p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1237\"><strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1162\">Bonuses:</strong> Extra rewards for top-performing creators and special campaign milestones.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1242\"><h3 data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1267\">• How to promote us</h3><ul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1619\"><li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1343\"><p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1343\">Share high-quality photos or Reels of you styling Limani London pieces.</p></li><li data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1430\"><p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1430\">Feature unboxing videos or “sparkle tests” in natural light to show craftsmanship.</p></li><li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1535\"><p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1535\">Include your personal discount code in captions, bios, stories, blog posts, or YouTube descriptions.</p></li><li data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1619\"><p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1619\">Leverage seasonal moments—engagement season, weddings, holidays, Valentine’s Day.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\"><h3 data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1649\">• Other information</h3><ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"2065\"><li data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1738\"><p data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1738\">Affiliates receive <strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1687\">early access</strong> to new collections and occasional gifted pieces.</p></li><li data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1829\"><p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1829\">We provide a <strong data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1767\">media kit</strong> with product images, lifestyle shots, and brand guidelines.</p></li><li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1981\"><p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1981\">Full real-time tracking and payouts are handled through <strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1919\">&nbsp;UpPromote</strong>, so you can monitor clicks, sales, and commissions anytime.</p></li><li data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2065\"><p data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2065\">Our team is here for support—questions, content ideas, or bespoke collaborations.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
